  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say Process II must be \"fully utilized,\" do you mean the 70 regular hours must be completely used up (i.e., exactly 70 hours of regular Process II time consumed, with any extra production beyond that requiring overtime), or do you mean the total Process II time including overtime must be used up to whatever level is needed?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy clarification regarding the definition of 'fully utilized' for Process II, presenting two mutually exclusive interpretations as a single choice."
}

